Description: desktop synchronization client for OpenCloud
 OpenCloud Desktop is a tool to synchronize files from an OpenCloud
 server with your computer. It provides a graphical client with a
 system tray icon as well as a command line tool (opencloudcmd) for
 scripting and headless setups.
